Maintainer: Kernora Developers <developers@kernora.invalid>
Standards-Version: 4.7.4
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: kernora-base
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 base-files (= 13.8+deb13u6+kernora1),
 kernora-archive (>= 1.0)
Description: Kernora OS base system and hardware defaults
 This package depends on the Kernora-specific packages required by every
 Kernora OS installation: the system identity and the package archives
 that keep it updated.
 .
 It also provides hardware-specific defaults, including a NetworkManager
 power-saving workaround for the Realtek RTL8852CE wireless adapter.
 Removing it does not remove its dependencies, but may prevent future
 base-system additions from being installed automatically.
